		{
			"id": "eDAbcmD5IGFiWiy5g",
			"description": "Incubus Klaive",
			"local_notes": "Field-on line carries armour divisor (10). Two-handed only.\n\nLore: The Incubus's two-handed power blade: a long, heavy, elegantly barbed weapon, wielded with terrifying skill by the mercenary swordsmen of Arhra (Codex: Drukhari background). It is the tool of the master duellist and is used one-handed by no Incubus.\n\nDesign: Power-field rule again: the mundane baseline for a two-handed sword-length blade is sw+3 cut (a greatsword), and the field adds +3d and (10): sw+3d+3(10) cut. Exact dice at an Incubus's ST 12 (sw 1d+2, so 4d+5): flak 100.0%, carapace 100.0%, Astartes plate 99.6%, Terminator plate 44.4% (44.6% with WP 3). It is the best power-field weapon in Drukhari hands at range 1-2, and the best of the two Incubus patterns against a Terminator; the Incubi are the Drukhari's answer to heavy armour in melee. Handling: 6.5 lb, min ST 11 two-handed, reach 1,2, parry 0, Two-Handed Sword.",
			"tags": [
				"Melee Weapon",
				"Xenos",
				"Drukhari",
				"Incubi"
			],
			"tech_level": "11^",
			"legality_class": "0",
