		{
			"id": "eSVFCP2RPnjs2gKQA",
			"description": "Agoniser (Whip)",
			"local_notes": "Field-on line carries armour divisor (10). Agony follow-up: if the field-on strike penetrates DR, roll HT-3 or suffer Severe Pain (-4 to all IQ- and DX-based rolls, B428) for a number of minutes equal to the margin of failure; a critical failure also stuns the victim. High Pain Threshold gives +3 to the roll (GM's call for other pain resistance). No effect on machines or on anything that does not feel pain.\n\nLore: The signature torture-weapon of the Wych Cults (Succubi and Hekatrixes) and a common Haemonculus tool: a whip or lash whose field is tuned to overload the pain nerves rather than cut the flesh, so that the victim suffers agony out of proportion to the wound (Codex: Drukhari background). It is at least as much an instrument of torture as of war.\n\nDesign: The framework's anchor: 'neural-whip or blade: a field weapon (10) plus a pain affliction; agony rather than cutting power'. The field is on the power-field rule (armour divisor (10), field-off mundane baseline) but the damage is deliberately low: sw+1d-1 field on (2d at a Wych's ST 11), well under the +3d power weapons, since the field is tuned to pain rather than to shearing (a mundane whip is sw-2 cut). The (10) divisor is what lets the pain reach the victim through armour, and the pain, not the wound, is the weapon. Exact dice: at a Succubus's ST 12 (sw 1d+2, so 2d+1 field on) it penetrates flak 97.2%, carapace 58.3%, Astartes plate 16.7% (18.0% with WP 4) and never Terminator plate; at a Wych's ST 11 (2d) 91.7/41.7/8.3%. It is not a Marine-killer and not meant to be; a Marine's High Pain Threshold gives +3 against the affliction anyway. Affliction rules follow the project's other pain-based items: penetration gates the follow-up, and the HT roll resists it. Handling: 2.5 lb (a slim handle with the field generator), min ST 8, reach 1-3, parry 'No' (a whip cannot parry), Whip skill (defaults DX-5, Flail-3).",
			"tags": [
				"Melee Weapon",
				"Xenos",
				"Drukhari",
				"Wych Cult",
				"Haemonculus Coven"
			],
			"tech_level": "11^",
			"legality_class": "0",
			"base_value": "10000",
			"base_weight": "2.5 lb",
			"weapons": [
				{
					"id": "wfTsvCRfiAten9nk1",
					"sv": 1,
					"damage": {
						"type": "cut",
						"st": "sw",
						"base": "1d-1",
						"armor_divisor": 10
					},
					"reach": "1-3",
					"parry": "No",
					"strength": "8",
					"usage": "Field on",
					"defaults": [
						{
							"type": "dx",
							"modifier": -5
						},
						{
							"type": "skill",
							"name": {
								"compare": "is",
								"qualifier": "Flail"
							},
							"modifier": -3
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"id": "wCSXJGwPq-GrmKdgq",
					"sv": 1,
					"damage": {
						"type": "cut",
						"st": "sw",
						"base": "-2"
					},
					"reach": "1-3",
