					"usage_notes": "Agony follow-up: if the field-on strike penetrates DR, roll HT-3 or suffer Severe Pain (-4 to all IQ- and DX-based rolls, B428) for a number of minutes equal to the margin of failure; a critical failure also stuns the victim. High Pain Threshold gives +3 to the roll (GM's call for other pain resistance). No effect on machines or on anything that does not feel pain.",
