					"reach": "C,1",
					"parry": "0",
					"strength": "10",
					"usage": "Toxin follow-up (if the punch penetrates)",
					"usage_notes": "Only if the crushing damage penetrates DR: the grafted spurs inject a coven toxin. Living targets only.",
					"defaults": [
