			"quantity": 1
		},
		{
			"id": "e2UqpoTRD9LQo_WFt",
			"description": "Electrocorrosive Whip",
			"local_notes": "A whip that is also a wire of corrosive acid and electric charge. Does not parry.\n\nLore: A Haemonculus's whip that both corrodes and shocks its victim (Codex: Drukhari background). A tool of the flesh-sculptor's torture chamber more than a battlefield arm.\n\nDesign: A mundane whip with a follow-up and no field: lash sw(2) cor (corrosion wounds x1, and the acid coating gives it the (2) divisor) plus a 2d burn discharge if the lash penetrates. Exact dice at a Haemonculus's ST 13 (sw 2d-1, average 6): flak 0.0% (4.5% with WP 7), carapace 0.0%, Astartes 0.0%. A whip's low damage cannot make use of even a (2) edge against armour; it is a weapon for exposed flesh. Handling: 2 lb, min ST 7, reach 1-3, parry 'No', Whip.",
			"tags": [
				"Melee Weapon",
				"Xenos",
				"Drukhari",
				"Haemonculus Coven"
			],
			"tech_level": "10^",
